  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shaping Pakistan&#x2019;s Climate Prosperity Plan to Advance Inclusive and  Equitable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To act as a catalyst for a climate-responsive economic and fiscal framework for Pakistan by designing and promoting an actionable roadmap, and fostering mutual learning with policymakers, communities, journalists, and academia. Additionally, drawing on Denmark&#x2019;s best practices to amplify Pakistan&#x2019;s climate-smart actions on both national and international platforms.</narrative>
  </description>
